  "charactorIcon":"10",
  "charactorId":19103000,
  "displayStyle":1,
  "isClearForward":true,
  "nexTalkId":109117,
  "text":"正是如此。\n而且持有者拥有召唤魔界之王中的恶魔领主的能力……",
  "EnglishText":"That's the case. \n and the holder has the ability to call the demon lord of the king of the demon world." },
{ 
  "talkId":109117,
  "charactorName":"雪莉",
  "charactorEnglishName":"Sherry",
  "charactorIcon":"2",
  "charactorId":18004000,
  "displayStyle":1,
  "isClearForward":true,
  "nexTalkId":109118,
  "text":"如果使用那种怪物的话，咱们是对付不了的。没有别的办法了吗？",
  "EnglishText":"If you use that monster, we can't deal with it. Is there any other way?" },
{ 
  "talkId":109118,
  "charactorName":"司祭",
  "charactorEnglishName":"Confessor",
  "charactorIcon":"10",
  "charactorId":19103000,
  "displayStyle":1,
  "isClearForward":true,
  "nexTalkId":109119,
  "text":"其实现在的阿鲁扎哈托还未完全觉醒。若要完全觉醒，还需要黑暗魔杖的力量。",
  "EnglishText":"In fact, Alhazard is still not fully awakened. If you want to be fully awakened, you need the power of the dark wand." },
{ 
  "talkId":109119,
  "charactorName":"艾尔文",
  "charactorEnglishName":"Elwin",
  "charactorIcon":"0X",
  "charactorId":18000000,
  "displayStyle":1,
  "isClearForward":true,
  "nexTalkId":109120,
  "text":"也就是说黑暗魔杖是关键是吧？",
  "EnglishText":"That is to say the dark wand is the key, right?" },
{ 
  "talkId":109120,
  "charactorName":"司祭",
  "charactorEnglishName":"Confessor",
  "charactorIcon":"10",
  "charactorId":19103000,
  "displayStyle":1,
  "isClearForward":true,
  "nexTalkId":109121,
  "text":"是的，但我不知道黑暗魔杖的下落……",
  "EnglishText":"Yes, but I don't know the whereabouts of the dark wand..." },
{ 
  "talkId":109121,
  "charactorName":"司祭",
  "charactorEnglishName":"Confessor",
  "charactorIcon":"10",
  "charactorId":19103000,
  "displayStyle":1,
  "isClearForward":true,
  "nexTalkId":109122,
  "text":"不过……\n在拉鲁河畔有一位神秘的大魔术师，他或许有黑暗魔杖的线索。",
  "EnglishText":"But... \nThere is a mysterious magician in Lalu River, he may have dark wand clues." },
{ 
  "talkId":109122,
  "charactorName":"雪莉",
  "charactorEnglishName":"Sherry",
  "charactorIcon":"2",
  "charactorId":18004000,
  "displayStyle":1,
  "isClearForward":true,
  "nexTalkId":109123,
  "text":"那么，接下来，大家要去拜访那位大魔术师了吧……",
  "EnglishText":"Then, next, everyone is going to visit the magician..." },
{ 
  "talkId":109123,
  "charactorName":"雪莉",
  "charactorEnglishName":"Sherry",
  "charactorIcon":"2",
  "charactorId":18004000,
  "displayStyle":1,
  "isClearForward":true,
  "nexTalkId":109124,
  "text":"好，修整一下准备出发了！",
  "EnglishText":"OK, get ready to start!" },
{ 
