  "charactorEnglishName":"Elwin",
  "charactorIcon":"0X",
  "charactorId":18000000,
  "displayStyle":1,
  "isClearForward":true,
  "nexTalkId":109127,
  "text":"你怎么了。\n留在这里的话，城里的人会保护你的。什么也不用担心。",
  "EnglishText":"What's wrong with you。 If \n stays here, the people in the city will protect you. You don't have to worry about anything." },
{ 
